# Recipe content

When the user asks to add or update a recipe, grocery, pantry staple, or kitchen stock, read `docs/ADD_RECIPE.md` before making changes.

- Use the recipe content API/data layer; never create a Prisma migration for routine recipe or grocery content.
- Preserve the distinction between shopping/stock (`pantryStaple`) and nutrition (`excludeFromNutrition`).
- Reuse the project's canonical grocery names and package sizes. Do not create near-duplicates.
